      "note": "Root cause fixed by the patch. `get_num()` narrows the parsed decimal value from `mrb_int next_n` into 32-bit `int` without first checking whether it fits in `INT_MAX`, so oversized numeric format specifiers become negative `prec`/`width` values instead of being rejected.",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
